  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart Solutions Veles - To be continued&#xbf;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action is relevant to the aim of the IPA 2020 &apos;&apos;EU for Municipalities&apos;&apos; programme for piloting innovative solutions to local problems in the municipalities. The project will aim at directly removing obstacles for all residents and visitors to Veles city centre area, as it pilots an innovative smart solution for re-organization of the urban mobility and transportation means.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
